    "description": "<p>You see how your allies are trying to put forth their best effort, so you put some weight behind their efforts. When an allied creature is casting a Jutsu as an Action, you can spend 1 Command Dice, giving their attacks advantage.</p>\n<p>You can also share in their jutsu cost. By spending up to 3 White Chakra, you reduce the jutsu’s cost by -2, for every White chakra spent this way.</p>",
